    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44303" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκρᾱσία</span></b>  (late <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκοσμ-κρᾰσίη</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Man.
			5.59
		</span></i>), ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>good temperature, mildness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὡρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					24c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἀέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					34.8.4
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				860b12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ταῖς εὐκρασίαις</span> in
				<i>good climates</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.21.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. τοῦ σώματος</span>
			<i>good temperament</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				673b25
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				744a30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.31
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
